sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Chog Buddy app
  participant B as Bet page
  participant S as Server
  participant C as FocusPool
  P->>B: open /focus?port&state
  B->>P: GET /focus (app answers)
  B->>C: approve + stake(goal, hash(key))
  B->>P: POST bet id + key
  loop every 30 s
    P->>S: progress(focus minutes)
    S-->>P: Open / Won
  end
  S->>C: settle Won
  P->>P: celebrate + notify
  B->>C: claim stake + bonus
